# JustAC hand pin, WoW Forever: Restoration Druid damage while there is nothing to heal. The
# sim list source (tools/forever-apl-src) models no healer, and the guides only say "spare
# time: regen or damage" (Documentation/forever-guides/druid-shaman.md), so a plain filler.
# Supported conditions: target.health.pct<N, [!]dot.X.ticking, active_enemies>=N.

actions=moonfire,if=!dot.moonfire.ticking
actions+=/wrath
